      "speaker": "a",
      "text": "王明，你怎么样？",
      "reading": "Wáng Míng, nǐ zěnmeyàng?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "b",
      "text": "我觉得不舒服。",
      "reading": "Wǒ juéde bù shūfu."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "a",
      "text": "你生病了吗？去医院吧！",
      "reading": "Nǐ shēngbìng le ma? Qù yīyuàn ba!"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "b",
      "text": "没事，我想在家休息。",
      "reading": "Méishì, wǒ xiǎng zài jiā xiūxi."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "a",
      "text": "好，你多喝水！",
      "reading": "Hǎo, nǐ duō hē shuǐ!"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "b",
      "text": "谢谢你，小南！",
      "reading": "Xièxie nǐ, Xiǎonán!"
